Package: vajra-core
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, bash, systemd, procps, util-linux, coreutils
Recommends: vajra-security-center, vajra-control-center, vajra-service-manager
Suggests: vajra-package-manager, vajra-update-manager
Description: Vajra OS Core System — boot, process, memory, filesystem, device, display, service, user, session managers
 Vajra OS (वज्र OS) core system infrastructure. This package contains the
 fundamental OS management tools that every Vajra installation needs:
 .
  * vajra-boot-manager    — Boot process, GRUB, kernel selection, initramfs
  * vajra-process-manager — Process states, signals, IPC, process tree, monitor
  * vajra-memory-manager  — Virtual memory, swap, OOM killer, memory maps
  * vajra-filesystem-manager — VFS, mount, permissions, format, fsck
  * vajra-device-manager  — Hardware detection, PCI/USB, driver loading
  * vajra-display-server  — X11/Wayland, resolution, multi-monitor, brightness
  * vajra-service-manager — systemd wrapper, targets, timers, sockets
  * vajra-user-session-manager — Users, groups, sessions, PAM, login
 .
 These are the building blocks that make Vajra OS a real operating system,
 not just a themed Linux distribution.
